.TH QUIPU-ATTEST-REGISTER 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-attest\-register \- Register a session binding for attested writes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu attest register\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-agent\fR] [\fB\-\-session\fR] [\fB\-\-public\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-introducer\fR] [\fB\-\-issued\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-expires\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-write\fR] [\fB\-\-require\-v2\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Register a session binding for attested writes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-session\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-public\-key\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-introducer\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-issued\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-expires\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-write\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-require\-v2\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
